# Alhaitham Emilie Mavuika Xianyun. ~19s Rot. Alhaitham Burning Plunge. AlHaitham NAs after each plunge for mirror triggers. Xianyun adds extra N1s before and after ElPQ to clear burning so Mavuika can trigger Scroll again. 60% Collisions.

# Team - Options ordered by DPS
haitham char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
haitham add weapon="harbinger" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
#haitham add weapon="finale" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
#haitham add weapon="lionsroar" refine=3 lvl=90/90;
haitham add set="ur" count=4;
#haitham add set="longnightsoath" count=4;
haitham add stats hp=4780 atk=311 atk%=0.466 dendro%=0.466 cr=0.311;
haitham add stats def%=0.124 def=39.36 hp=507.88 hp%=0.0992 atk=33.08 atk%=0.1984 er=0.1102 em=39.64 cr=0.331 cd=0.7944;

emilie char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9; 
